  "job_B23.3.2.2_20251003_114604": {
    "text": "On anre nihta eald monan, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee m\u00e6te\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t cym\u00f0 to gefean.\nOn tweigra nihta eald monan & on \u00fereora n\u00e6f \u00fe\u00e6t swefen n\u00e6nige fremednesse godes ne yfeles.\nOn feower nihta & on fifa, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 god swefen, wite \u00feu, \u00fe\u00e6t georne on \u00feinre heortan.\nOn vi nihta \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu geseo \u00fe\u00e6t beo f\u00e6st on \u00feinum breostum, wite, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein \u00feanc ne losige.\nOn vii nihta, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee on eage byre\u00f0, \u00e6fter tide cym\u00f0 seo endung.\nOn viii nihta & on ix, sona \u00fe\u00e6t ype\u00f0, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee geswefna\u00f0, gif \u00feu unrotnysse gesawe, wend \u00fein\nOn x nihta \u00fein swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecednysse.\nOn xi \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 mid gefean.\nOn xii nihta & on xiii binnan \u00ferim nihton \u00feu gesihst, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00fee \u00e6r on swefne \u00e6tywde.\nOn xiiii nihta, n\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nige fremednysse godes ne yfeles.\nOn xv nihta, sceortwyrplic \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0.\nOn xvi nihta \u00e6fter langre tide hit ag\u00e6\u00f0.\nOn xvii & on xviii & on xix nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t swefen bi\u00f0 god & on manegum dagum geenda\u00f0.\nOn xx & on xxi nihta \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 ceapunge & hwearfunge.\nOn xxii & xxiii nihta, seo m\u00e6tingc bi\u00f0 gecornes & geflites & eall costunge full, ne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t na god\nOn xxiiii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 gesynto & h\u00e6lo.\nOn xxv & on xxvi nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 toweardlice firhto & brogan & on ix dagum o\u00fe\u00fee on x \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0\nOn xxvii & on xxviii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 ealne gefean, & ealle angnysse & unea\u00f0nysse smyltnysse &\nOn xxix nihta, eall swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rre.\nOn xxx nihta, \u00e6r twegra nihta fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecnum \u00feingum.",
